+R0 acceptance uses the evidence checklist without Codex. R1 requires a separate
+OpenCode reviewer; R2/R3 and final stage acceptance require Codex. The coordinator
+does not write product code or make new architectural decisions. Codex returns
+its bounded architectural/review decision and ends its turn; it does not poll.
